        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quiz-faq">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 data-i18n="quizWhyWorks">Why this quiz works</h2>
      <p data-i18n-html="quizWhyP1">Most productivity advice is generic. It tells you to "wake up at 5 AM" or "do a 75 Hard" — but if your archetype doesn't match the protocol, you'll fail. This quiz identifies your natural strength and gives you a system that fits <em>your</em> wiring — not someone else's.</p>
      <p data-i18n="quizWhyP2">Built from patterns I observed coaching and studying 200+ people over 8 years. It's not clinical psychology, but it's accurate enough to give you a useful starting point.</p>
      <p data-i18n="quizWhyP3">The four archetypes are not labels — they are starting points. You can move between them. The goal is not to box you in. The goal is to give you a protocol that respects how you actually work, not how you wish you worked.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quiz-archetypes">
    <div class="container">
