      <div class="archetype-grid">
        <div class="archetype-card">
          <span class="archetype-emoji">🧱</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="quizBuilderName">The Builder</h3>
          <p data-i18n="quizBuilderDesc">You compound small wins into unrecognisable lives. Daily consistency is your superpower. You trust the process even when nothing visible happens.</p>
          <p><strong data-i18n="quizBuilderBlind">Blind spot:</strong> <span data-i18n="quizBuilderBlindDetail">You over-build and rarely launch. Your strength (foundation) can become your trap (never shipping).</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-card">
          <span class="archetype-emoji">⚡</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="quizSprinterName">The Sprinter</h3>
          <p data-i18n="quizSprinterDesc">You do impossible things in 30 days. Then you reset. You execute under deadlines and thrive on intensity and novelty.</p>
          <p><strong data-i18n="quizSprinterBlind">Blind spot:</strong> <span data-i18n="quizSprinterBlindDetail">The crash after the sprint. You lose momentum between cycles. Stack a Sprinter with a Builder ritual.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-card">
          <span class="archetype-emoji">🏃</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="quizMarathonerName">The Marathoner</h3>
          <p data-i18n="quizMarathonerDesc">You win by never quitting. Consistency is your religion. Identity shifts happen deep and last.</p>
          <p><strong data-i18n="quizMarathonerBlind">Blind spot:</strong> <span data-i18n="quizMarathonerBlindDetail">You can become so patient you forget to push intensity. Slow becomes stuck. Add a sharpening phase every quarter.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-card">
          <span class="archetype-emoji">🎯</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="quizStrategistName">The Strategist</h3>
          <p data-i18n="quizStrategistDesc">You build systems that compound while you sleep. You see the leverage others miss. Tools and automation are your edge.</p>
          <p><strong data-i18n="quizStrategistBlind">Blind spot:</strong> <span data-i18n="quizStrategistBlindDetail">You optimize the system instead of doing the work. Strategy becomes procrastination. Block one "no-strategy" day per week.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quiz-howto">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 data-i18n="quizHowToUse">How to Use Your Result</h2>
      <ol class="howto-steps">
        <li data-i18n="quizHowP1"><strong>Take the quiz.</strong> Answer all 5 questions honestly. There's no right or wrong answer — only what's true for you.</li>
        <li data-i18n="quizHowP2"><strong>Read your archetype.</strong> Understand your strengths and blind spots. The protocol is your starting point, not your final destination.</li>
        <li data-i18n="quizHowP3"><strong>Apply the 30-day protocol.</strong> Follow the custom plan for your type. Track starts, not finishes. The 2-day rule protects the streak.</li>
        <li data-i18n="quizHowP4"><strong>Review after 30 days.</strong> Ask: did this fit? If yes, continue. If no, adjust. The goal is progress, not perfection.</li>
        <li data-i18n="quizHowP5"><strong>Share your type.</strong> Send it to your accountability partner. Social commitment increases the odds of showing up by 2-3x.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quiz-faq">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 data-i18n="quizFaqTitle">FAQ</h2>
      <details>
        <summary data-i18n="quizFaq1Q">Is this quiz really free?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="quizFaq1A">Yes. 100% free. No signup required to see results. No credit card. No email required. Just answer 5 questions and get your archetype.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary data-i18n="quizFaq2Q">How accurate is it?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="quizFaq2A">Built on patterns from coaching 200+ people over 8 years. Not clinical, but useful. Think of it as a compass, not a map. It points you in the right direction — you still have to walk.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary data-i18n="quizFaq3Q">Will I get a custom plan?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="quizFaq3A">Yes. Each archetype comes with a custom 30-day protocol based on your type. The protocol is specific, actionable, and designed for your natural wiring.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary data-i18n="quizFaq4Q">Can my archetype change?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="quizFaq4A">Yes. Your archetype can shift based on context, season of life, and the habit you're building. A Sprinter in fitness can be a Marathoner in writing. Retake the quiz every 90 days.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary data-i18n="quizFaq5Q">What if I'm between two archetypes?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="quizFaq5A">That's normal. Most people have a primary and a secondary. Read both protocols. Blend what works. The goal is not to fit a box — it's to build a system that serves you.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterSection variant="default" showLeadMagnet={true} title="Get your archetype's 30-day protocol by email." buttonText="Send My Protocol" />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://the-motivahub.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Tools", "item": "https://the-motivahub.com/#free-tools" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Discipline Type Quiz", "item": "https://the-motivahub.com/tools/discipline-quiz/" }
    ]
  })} />
</Layout>

<script define:vars={{ questions, archetypes, questionsFr, archetypesFr }}>
(function () {
  const i18nDict = window.i18nDict || {};
  const lang = localStorage.getItem("lang") || "en";
  const t = (i18nDict[lang] || i18nDict.en || {});
  const qs = lang === "fr" ? questionsFr : questions;
  const arch = lang === "fr" ? archetypesFr : archetypes;
  const total = qs.length;

  const state = { step: 0, scores: { builder: 0, sprinter: 0, marathoner: 0, strategist: 0 } };

  const body = document.getElementById('quiz-body');
  const progressText = document.getElementById('quiz-progress-text');
  const progressFill = document.getElementById('quiz-progress-fill');
  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('quiz-next');
  const backBtn = document.getElementById('quiz-back');
  const quizEl = document.getElementById('quiz');
  const resultEl = document.getElementById('quiz-result');

  function render() {
    const q = qs[state.step];
    progressText.textContent = (t.quizProgress || 'Question {n} of {total}').replace('{n}', state.step + 1).replace('{total}', total);
    progressFill.style.width = ((state.step + 1) / total * 100) + '%';
    body.innerHTML = '<h3 class="quiz-q">' + q.q + '</h3><div class="quiz-options">' +
      q.options.map((o, i) =>
        '<button class="quiz-option" data-score="' + o.score + '" data-i="' + i +'">' + o.text + '</button>'
      ).join('') + '</div>';
    backBtn.disabled = state.step === 0;
    nextBtn.disabled = true;
    nextBtn.textContent = state.step === total - 1 ? (t.quizSeeMyType || 'See My Type →') : (t.quizNext || 'Next →');

    body.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        body.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach((b) => b.classList.remove('selected'));
        btn.classList.add('selected');
        state.scores[btn.dataset.score] = (state.scores[btn.dataset.score] || 0) + 1;
        nextBtn.disabled = false;
      });
    });
  }

  function showResult() {
    const winner = Object.entries(state.scores).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];
    const a = arch[winner];
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-emoji').textContent = a.emoji;
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-name').textContent = a.name;
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-tagline').textContent = a.tagline;
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-strengths').innerHTML = a.strengths.map(s => '<li>' + s + '</li>').join('');
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-blindspot').textContent = a.blindSpot;
    document.getElementById('quiz-result-protocol').textContent = a.protocol;

    quizEl.hidden = true;
    resultEl.hidden = false;
    resultEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });

    if (typeof gtag !== 'undefined') {
      gtag('event', 'quiz_completed', { archetype: winner });
    }
  }

  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (state.step < total - 1) {
      state.step++;
      render();
    } else {
      showResult();
    }
  });

  backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (state.step > 0) {
      state.step--;
      render();
    }
  });

  document.getElementById('quiz-restart').addEventListener('click', () => {
    state.step = 0;
    state.scores = { builder: 0, sprinter: 0, marathoner: 0, strategist: 0 };
    quizEl.hidden = false;
    resultEl.hidden = true;
    render();
    quizEl.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  });

  render();
})();
</script>

<style>
  .quiz-head { padding: 80px 0 32px; text-align: center; }
  .quiz-sub { max-width: 600px; margin: 16px auto auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .quiz-main { padding: 32px 0 64px; }
  .quiz-shell {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
  }
  .quiz-progress {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .quiz-progress-bar {
    flex: 1;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--line);
    border-radius: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .quiz-progress-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--gold);
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
    width: 20%;
  }
  .quiz-q { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 24px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .quiz-options { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .quiz-option {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
